{"id":"n26633-1-8","stage":5,"title":"용기 · 容器","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26633-1-8-1","ko":"이거, 다 먹고 난 그릇은 어떻게 치우지?","zh":"这些吃完后的碗要怎么处理呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거,","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"먹고","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹고","audio":"/audio/b2dca7d94e3e3049878e.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"做完前面的动作（-고 나다）","explanation":"나다：做完前面的动作（-고 나다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"1","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"그릇은","meaning":"碗，器皿","explanation":"그릇：碗，器皿；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"그릇","audio":"/audio/7e60f5c15633cdc1f60c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31674","senseId":"1","lemma":"그릇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그릇은","audio":"/audio/cf31363437d56ce44900.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1"